.* QUIDSPCMD: DSPCMD, a command definition's attributes. Rows without a
.* label continue the value above them (modes, where allowed to run).
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 32'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=CMD CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=CMDLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PGM CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PGMLIB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PGMSTATE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SRCF CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SRCFLIB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SRCMBR CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=VLDCKR CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MODE1 CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MODE2 CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MODE3 CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ALLOW1 CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ALLOW2 CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ALLOW3 CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ALWLMTUSR CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MAXPOS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PMTFILE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PMTFILEL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MSGTXT CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MSGF CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MSGFLIB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=CURLIB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PRDLIB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=HLPPNLGRP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=HLPPNLGRPL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=HLPID CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PMTOVRPGM CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ENBGUI CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=THDSAFE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MLTTHDACN CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=CCSID CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=HLPSCHIDX CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=HLPSCHIDXL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=CMDTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:KEYL NAME=KEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPCMD KEYL=KEYS HELP=DSPCMDH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SPACE.Display Command Information
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATACOL WIDTH=24.
:DATACOL WIDTH=41.
:DATAI VAR=CMD USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CMD'.Command
:DATACOL WIDTH=24.
:DATACOL WIDTH=37.
:DATAI VAR=CMDLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CMDLIB'.Library
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATACOL WIDTH=40.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=PGM USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGM'.Program to process command
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=PGMLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGMLIB'.Library
:DATAI VAR=PGMSTATE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGMSTATE'.State used to call program
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=SRCF USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SRCF'.Source file
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=SRCFLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SRCFLIB'.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=SRCMBR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SRCMBR'.Source file member
:DATAI VAR=VLDCKR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/VLDCKR'.Validity checking program
:DATAI VAR=MODE1 USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MODE1'.Mode(s) in which valid
:DATAI VAR=MODE2 USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MODE2'.
:DATAI VAR=MODE3 USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MODE3'.
:DATAI VAR=ALLOW1 USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ALLOW1'.Where allowed to run
:DATAI VAR=ALLOW2 USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ALLOW2'.
:DATAI VAR=ALLOW3 USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ALLOW3'.
:DATAI VAR=ALWLMTUSR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ALWLMTUSR'.Allow limited user
:DATAI VAR=MAXPOS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MAXPOS'.Maximum positional parameters
:DATAI VAR=PMTFILE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PMTFILE'.Message file for prompt text
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=PMTFILEL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PMTFILEL'.Library
:DATAI VAR=MSGTXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MSGTXT'.Message text
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=MSGF USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MSGF'.Message file
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=MSGFLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MSGFLIB'.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=CURLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CURLIB'.Current library
:DATAI VAR=PRDLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRDLIB'.Product library
:DATAI VAR=HLPPNLGRP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/HLPPNLGRP'.Help panel group
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=HLPPNLGRPL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/HLPPNLGRPL'.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=HLPID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/HLPID'.Help identifier
:DATAI VAR=PMTOVRPGM USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PMTOVRPGM'.Prompt override program
:DATAI VAR=ENBGUI USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ENBGUI'.Enabled for graphical user interface
:DATAI VAR=THDSAFE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/THDSAFE'.Threadsafe
:DATAI VAR=MLTTHDACN USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MLTTHDACN'.Multithreaded job action
:DATAI VAR=CCSID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CCSID'.Coded character set ID
:DATAI VAR=HLPSCHIDX USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/HLPSCHIDX'.Help search index
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=HLPSCHIDXL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/HLPSCHIDXL'.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=CMDTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CMDTEXT'.Text
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=DSPCMDH.Display Command Information - Help
:P.What the command definition says: the program that processes the
command and the state it is called in, the source the definition was
made from, where and in which modes the command may run, and the
message files, libraries and help it uses. Page down for the rest.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 leaves the display; F12 goes back to where the command was
typed.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CMD'.Command
:P.The command shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CMDLIB'.Library
:P.The library shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PGM'.Program to process command
:P.The program to process command shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PGMLIB'.Library
:P.The library shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PGMSTATE'.State used to call program
:P.The state used to call program shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SRCF'.Source file
:P.The source physical file that holds the source member, by name and
library.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SRCFLIB'.Library
:P.The library shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SRCMBR'.Source file member
:P.The source file member shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
