:P.The MODE2 shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/MODE3'.MODE3
:P.The MODE3 shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/ALLOW1'.Where allowed to run
:P.The where allowed to run shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
