:P.The ALLOW2 shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/ALLOW3'.ALLOW3
:P.The ALLOW3 shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/ALWLMTUSR'.Allow limited user
:P.The allow limited user shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/MAXPOS'.Maximum positional parameters
:P.The maximum positional parameters shown for what the display is
about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PMTFILE'.Message file for prompt text
:P.The message file for prompt text shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PMTFILEL'.Library
:P.The library shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/MSGTXT'.Message text
:P.The text of the message.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/MSGF'.Message file
:P.The message file that holds the message descriptions, by name and
library.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/MSGFLIB'.Library
:P.The library shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CURLIB'.Current library
:P.The current library of the job&colon. the library searched first by
